      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "List price around $99 one-time on 4.0, frequently 50-90% off with discount codes. Black Friday and seasonal promos push to $20-$40 territory. Verify the live price on apextraderfunding.com — discounts run almost continuously."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does the $50K Apex eval cost?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "List around $249 one-time on 4.0; with discount codes typically $50-$30 depending on promotion. The $50K is the most popular plan among new traders because it balances eval cost against meaningful contract size."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How much does the $00K Apex eval cost?",
